                "text": "NEW: @repkevinhern and I introduced H.R. 4093, the Apples to Apples Comparison Act, to ensure seniors have clear, accurate info when choosing Medicare coverage. \n\nWith $1.3T in Medicare spending and millions relying on Medicare Advantage, flawed data puts access and benefits at risk. It\u2019s time to stop comparing apples to oranges. \ud83c\udf4e\ud83c\udf4a\n\nMORE: https://t.co/ozZNIUOXS0",
                "text_lang": "en",
