                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congratulations to @BaptistHealthJx Clay on the opening of their expanded Emergency Department!\n\nHaving seen over 38,000 patients this year already, this expansion will augment their ability to provide quality care to the residents of Clay County. This expansion adds 11 new patient rooms, bringing their total to 27.\n\nThank you to the #BaptistClay Team for taking me on a tour as well as participating in a roundtable discussion on the latest trends in the healthcare industry. We also had the opportunity to talk about how the One, Big Beautiful Bill strengthened, secured, and sustained Medicaid for the most vulnerable Americans.\n\nKeep up the great work, Baptist Clay! #BeanOnTour",
